    "body": "A finding on main `ec314174e` (Mac, debug):\n\n- `camcraft-ui` lib test `egui_app::setup_wcs_tests::the_combo_lists_the_setups_post_range_by_its_names` fails.\n- Panic at `crates/ui/src/egui_app/setup_wcs_tests.rs:158:5`: `left: 255`, `right: 9`. The combo lists \"Work offset 1 (G54)\" to \"Work offset 255 (G54.1 P255)\". The test expects 9 rows.\n- Command: `cargo xtask gate test the_combo_lists_the_setups_post_range_by_its_names --crate camcraft-ui`.\n- The test fails on the clean main tree. No open PR causes it. Recent changes near this code: `de5829e8f`, `671ccd19c`, and the merge of #4299 (`b4bcddbd1`, Tormach `G54.1 P`).\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
